            "review_title": "Review at Tron Dessert & Cafe",
            "review_text": "BusanGaz\nBeijing, China45 contributions\n0\nBest Coffee in Da Nang\nJan 2017 • Couples\nThe owner was super smiley, friendly and welcoming. I get the impression that this is a new cafe and she is trying her best to make it work. The Vietnamese filter coffee was potent and she instructed us on how to drink it. The Americano was probably the best I've had, and I'm somewhat of a coffee connoisseur. Not sure how they did it but the taste was smooth and rich and temperature was perfect. We went here everyday. Don't miss out!\nRead more\nWritten January 28, 2017",
